      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1314308242,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi Samy, thanks for working on this.\n\nI think the packet list background is too busy, but I think the [Logray icon background](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/resources/icons/lricon128.png) is too plain. Maybe a light gradient similar to the Safari application icon would work?\n\nDid you use Apple's [App Icons template](https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/) for the rounded squares?\n\n`resources/icons/wireshark.ico` and `packaging/macosx/Wireshark.icns` need to be updated as well.\n\nThere is also a suite of installation icons `resources/icons/wsiconinst*.*` that we might want to update.\n\nHave the .pngs been optimized? `tools/compress-pngs.py` will run various optimizers if they're installed.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
